2026-08-28T19:55:30+0530 | INFO     | travel_agent.adk_runner | ADK_TOOL_CALL session=reg-2 agent=itinerary_agent tool=save_itinerary_adk args={'city': 'Kyoto', 'plan_text': '**3-Day Itinerary for Kyoto**\n\n**Day 1: Exploring Temples and Shrines**  \n- Morning: Visit **Fushimi Inari Shrine**, famous for its thousands of vermillion torii gates.  \n- Lunch: Try **Yudofu**, a local tofu dish at a nearby restaurant.  \n- Afternoon: Visit **Kinkaku-ji (Golden Pavilion)** to admire its stunning architecture and serene surroundings.  \n- Evening: Check into **Ryokan Cultural Stay** for a traditional experience, relax in their onsen while enjoying a garden view.  \n\n**Day 2: Nature and Scenic Views**  \n- Morning: Head to **Arashiyama Bamboo Grove** for a peaceful stroll through towering bamboo.  \n- Lunch: Indulge in a **Kaiseki Dining** experience, a traditional multi-course Japanese meal.  \n- Afternoon: Explore the surrounding Arashiyama area, potentially taking a boat ride or visiting the monkey park.  \n- Evening: Return to the ryokan for another night of relaxation.  \n\n**Day 3: Cultural Immersion**  \n- Morning: Enjoy a light breakfast, followed by sampling **Matcha Parfait** at a local café.  \n- Late Morning: Visit additional sights like Nijo Castle or Kiyomizu-dera if time allows.  \n- Lunch: Final taste of local cuisine at a favorite spot.  \n- Afternoon: Last-minute shopping in traditional districts like Gion or Nishiki Market.  \n- Evening: Depart from Kyoto, cherishing the memories of a beautiful visit.'}
